{
  "headline": "FDA's records show multiple manufacturers on the shortage list since 2023-02-15; the Hikma plant in Portugal was classified VAI 12 days before the posting and again 65 days after; the Hospira plant in the US had OAI classifications in 2010 and 2011 with warning letters in 2010 and 2014",
  "headline_cites": ["E44", "D5", "D6", "E10", "E21", "E23", "E16"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the rocuronium bromide shortage on 2023-02-15 and as of 2026-10-21 it has been on the list for 44 months.",
      "cites": ["E44", "D10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The shortage list includes Baxter Healthcare, Eugia US LLC, Fresenius Kabi USA LLC, Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc., Hospira Inc., Meitheal Pharmaceuticals Inc., Mylan Institutional, Piramal Critical Care Inc., Sagent Pharmaceuticals, Sandoz Inc., and XGen Pharmaceuticals DJB Inc., all with Current status.",
      "cites": ["E32", "E33", "E35", "E36", "E37", "E38", "E39", "E40", "E41", "E42", "E43"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1254066 at the Hikma Farmaceutica (Portugal) S.A. plant ended 2023-02-03 and was classified VAI, 12 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D5", "E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1203129 at the same Hikma plant ended 2023-04-21 and was classified VAI, 65 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D6", "E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hospira Inc. plant (FEI 1021343) received OAI classifications after inspections ending 2010-01-19 and 2011-06-17, with a warning letter issued 2010-04-12.",
      "cites": ["E21", "E23", "E30"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A second Hospira inspection ending 2011-08-04 was also classified OAI, and a warning letter was issued to Hikma Farmaceutica (Portugal) S.A. on 2014-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E25", "E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based transfer option ranked 1 moves 13 units from Corvale Lakeside (29 days on hand) to Corvale East (8.3 days on hand, reaching 9 days), which requires a pharmacy director transfer request.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    }
  ]
}
